<title>USA: BEFORE THE BELL - EchoStar soars on alliance.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL - EchoStar soars on alliance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>EchoStar Communications Corp shares soared to 27 from 18 preceding Tuesday's U.S. market, a positive response to the company's direct broadcast satellite alliance with News Corp unveiled last night, traders said.</p>
<p>News Corp said it will contribute to EchoStar $1 billion in cash, satellites and other assets of News Corp's American Sky Broadcasting in return for 50 percent EchoStar equity.</p>
<p>MCI Communications Corp will own 20 percent of News Corp's 50 percent stake, or 10 percent of EchoStar.</p>
